{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"flow-group","type":"group","x":1840,"y":-70,"width":900,"height":1515,"color":"4","label":"🎮 How one game plays out"},
		{"id":"j-settings","type":"text","text":"### Settings\n- Numbers 1–100\n- 5 guesses","x":1360,"y":-69,"width":320,"height":135,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"j-memory","type":"text","text":"### Remembers\n- The secret number\n- How many guesses are left","x":1360,"y":90,"width":320,"height":135,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"j-start","type":"text","text":"### `startNewGame()`\n- Picks a new secret number\n- Resets guesses to 5\n- Clears the screen","x":1360,"y":249,"width":320,"height":161,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"j-guess","type":"text","text":"### `handleGuess()`\n- Checks the guess is 1–100\n- Uses up a guess\n- Too high? Too low? Correct?","x":1360,"y":434,"width":320,"height":161,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"j-feedback","type":"text","text":"### `showFeedback()`\n- Writes the message\n- Picks its colour","x":1360,"y":619,"width":320,"height":135,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"j-showpopup","type":"text","text":"### `showPopup()`\n- Win or lose message\n- Shows the secret number if you lost\n- Locks the guess box","x":1360,"y":778,"width":320,"height":187,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"j-close","type":"text","text":"### `closePopup()`\n- Waits 1 second first ⏱️\n- Hides the pop-up\n- Starts a new game","x":1360,"y":989,"width":320,"height":161,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f1","type":"text","text":"### 1️⃣ Page loads\nA secret number is picked\n⚙️ `startNewGame()`","x":1880,"y":0,"width":380,"height":135,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f2","type":"text","text":"### 2️⃣ Player types a guess\n…and presses **Enter** or **Guess**\n⚙️ `handleGuess()`","x":1880,"y":195,"width":380,"height":135,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f3","type":"text","text":"### 3️⃣ Is it a whole number from 1–100?","x":1880,"y":390,"width":380,"height":118,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f3no","type":"text","text":"### ⚠️ Not valid\n“Please enter a whole number from 1 to 100.”\n**No guess used up**\n⚙️ `showFeedback()`","x":2320,"y":370,"width":380,"height":187,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"f4","type":"text","text":"### 4️⃣ Use up one guess\nCompare with the secret number\n⚙️ `handleGuess()`","x":1880,"y":568,"width":380,"height":135,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f4hint","type":"text","text":"### 🔴 Too high / Too low\nGuesses left? Try again!\n⚙️ `showFeedback()`","x":2320,"y":578,"width":380,"height":135,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"root","type":"text","text":"# 🐾 Bluey Number Guessing Game\nGuess the secret number from **1 to 100** in **5 tries**.\nEach file has **one job** — follow the branches to see who does what.","x":900,"y":-620,"width":640,"height":149,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"h-count","type":"text","text":"### Guesses left\n- Big number `#remaining-count`","x":480,"y":434,"width":320,"height":109,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"css","type":"text","text":"## 🎨 [[style.css]]\n**Costumes & paint** — decides how things *look*","x":880,"y":-260,"width":360,"height":141,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c-colors","type":"text","text":"### Bluey colours\n- Bluey blue, Bingo orange, cream, grass green","x":920,"y":-69,"width":320,"height":135,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c-yard","type":"text","text":"### The backyard\n- Sky-blue background\n- Green grass hill","x":920,"y":90,"width":320,"height":135,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c-card","type":"text","text":"### Card & buttons\n- Big rounded corners\n- Bouncy buttons","x":920,"y":249,"width":320,"height":135,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c-feedback","type":"text","text":"### Message colours\n- 🔴 too high / too low\n- 🟠 not a valid number\n- 🟢 correct!","x":920,"y":408,"width":320,"height":161,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c-popup","type":"text","text":"### Pop-up look\n- 🟢 green box = win\n- 🔴 red box = lose\n- Pops in with an animation","x":920,"y":593,"width":320,"height":161,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c-phone","type":"text","text":"### Small phones\n- Box and button stack on top of each other","x":920,"y":778,"width":320,"height":135,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"js","type":"text","text":"## ⚙️ [[script.js]]\n**The referee** — makes the game *work*","x":1320,"y":-260,"width":360,"height":141,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"plan","type":"text","text":"## 📋 The Plan\n*Written before any code*","x":0,"y":-260,"width":360,"height":115,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"claude","type":"text","text":"### [[CLAUDE.md]] — the rulebook\n- Number from 1–100, 5 guesses\n- Say **too high / too low / correct**\n- Always show guesses left\n- Pop-up when you win or lose\n- Closing it starts a new game\n- Keep it simple!","x":40,"y":-95,"width":320,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"wireframe","type":"file","file":"resources/number guessing wireframe.png","x":40,"y":229,"width":320,"height":307,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"html","type":"text","text":"## 🏠 [[index.html]]\n**The stage set** — decides *what* is on the page","x":440,"y":-260,"width":360,"height":141,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"h-head","type":"text","text":"### Page setup\n- Loads the Fredoka font\n- Loads **style.css**","x":480,"y":-69,"width":320,"height":135,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"h-card","type":"text","text":"### Game card\n- Title: *Guess a Number*\n- The rules text","x":480,"y":90,"width":320,"height":135,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"h-form","type":"text","text":"### Guess area\n- Number box `#guess-input`\n- **Guess** button\n- Message line `#feedback`","x":480,"y":249,"width":320,"height":161,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"h-popup","type":"text","text":"### Pop-up (hidden at first)\n- Message `#popup-message`\n- Button `#popup-button`","x":480,"y":567,"width":320,"height":170,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"h-hill","type":"text","text":"### Backyard hill\n- Just decoration 🌳","x":480,"y":761,"width":320,"height":109,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"h-script","type":"text","text":"### Loads **script.js** last\n- So every element exists before the game starts","x":480,"y":894,"width":320,"height":170,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"wf-label","type":"text","text":"**Wireframe** — the architect's sketch of the 4 screens","x":40,"y":571,"width":320,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"tools","type":"text","text":"## 🛠️ Helpers\n*Not part of the game — they help us build it*","x":2800,"y":-260,"width":360,"height":141,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-qa","type":"text","text":"### 🧪 qa-agent\n- Plays the game in a real browser using **Playwright**\n- Checks features + phone & desktop layout\n- Needs Playwright added with:\n`claude mcp add playwright -- npx @playwright/mcp@latest`","x":2840,"y":-69,"width":320,"height":265,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-mapper","type":"text","text":"### 🗺️ project-mapper\n- Reads the code (can't change it)\n- Writes the documentation","x":2840,"y":220,"width":320,"height":161,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-map","type":"text","text":"### 📖 [[PROJECT_MAP.md]]\n- The full written guide, with line numbers","x":2840,"y":405,"width":320,"height":135,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"f5win","type":"text","text":"### 🎉 Correct!\nGreen pop-up\n**Play Again**\n⚙️ `showPopup()`","x":1880,"y":793,"width":250,"height":187,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f5lose","type":"text","text":"### 😢 Out of guesses\nRed pop-up shows the number\n**Try Again**\n⚙️ `showPopup()`","x":2160,"y":793,"width":250,"height":187,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"f6","type":"text","text":"### 5️⃣ Player closes the pop-up\n(ignored for the first second, so a quick extra Enter can't skip it)\n⚙️ `closePopup()`","x":1880,"y":1040,"width":380,"height":161,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f7","type":"text","text":"### 🔁 New game starts automatically\n⚙️ `startNewGame()`","x":1880,"y":1261,"width":380,"height":144,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"### 🗝️ How to read this map\n**Colours**\n🟣 plan · 🔵 index.html · 🟠 style.css · 🟢 script.js · 🟡 helpers\n\n**Arrows**\n- Grey: *this file contains…*\n- Red, labelled: *files talking to each other*\n- Green/red in the game box: *what happens next*\n- Cyan: *which function handles that step*","x":0,"y":-620,"width":520,"height":317}
	],
